      "originalText": "\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/1 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/1 subinterface 0 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/1 subinterface 0 ipv4 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/1 subinterface 0 ipv4 address 10.0.2.2/24\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/2 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/2 subinterface 0 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/2 subinterface 0 ipv4 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/2 subinterface 0 ipv4 address 10.1.12.1/24\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/3 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/3 subinterface 0 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/3 subinterface 0 ipv4 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/3 subinterface 0 ipv4 address 10.1.11.1/24\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/4 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/4 subinterface 0 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/4 subinterface 0 ipv4 admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / interface ethernet-1/4 subinterface 0 ipv4 address 10.1.10.1/24\nA:srl3# set / network-instance default admin-state enable\nA:srl3# set / network-instance default interface ethernet-1/1.0\nA:srl3# set / network-instance default interface ethernet-1/2.0\nA:srl3# set / network-instance default interface ethernet-1/3.0\nA:srl3# set / network-instance default interface ethernet-1/4.0\n",
